{"type":"message","id":"985795f0","parentId":"76acae3d","timestamp":"2026-02-18T12:42:35.517Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-02-18 18:12 GMT+5:30] URGENT: You are the Social Media agent. Your task: 1) Install Node.js dependencies: npm install pdfjs-dist canvas (canvas may require build tools; if it fails, we'll use a simpler approach). 2) Write a script that reads the sample PDF at C:\\Users\\mangs\\Desktop\\Content Marketing\\automated_content\\sample_slide\\1771414106196.pdf, renders the first page to an image using pdfjs-dist, and analyzes dominant colors, approximate font sizes, and layout. 3) From that analysis, generate a Marp CSS theme (size 1000x1200) that matches the sample's style. 4) Use the existing slide-gen tool (openclaw-slide-generator.js) with this theme to create a 10-12 page demo deck (use example-openclaw-slides.json content). 5) Output the resulting PDF and the CSS theme file. 6) Report back with: success/failure, paths to generated files, and any issues encountered. Run quietly, no questions. Expected runtime: up to 60 minutes."}],"timestamp":1771418555511}}
{"type":"message","id":"43eeacbb","parentId":"985795f0","timestamp":"2026-02-18T12:42:40.097Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to perform a specific task as a Social Media agent. Let me break down what I need to do:\n\n1. Install Node.js dependencies: `npm install pdfjs-dist canvas`\n2. Write a script to:\n   - Read sample PDF at `C:\\Users\\mangs\\Desktop\\Content Marketing\\automated_content\\sample_slide\\1771414106196.pdf`\n   - Render first page to an image using pdfjs-dist\n   - Analyze dominant colors, approximate font sizes, and layout\n3. Generate a Marp CSS theme (size 1000x1200) that matches the sample's style\n4. Use existing slide-gen tool (`openclaw-slide-generator.js`) with this theme to create a 10-12 page demo deck using `example-openclaw-slides.json` content\n5. Output the resulting PDF and the CSS theme file\n6. Report back with success/failure, paths to generated files, and any issues\n\nI need to start by understanding the workspace structure. Let me first read the AGENTS.md file to understand my role as a subagent, and then check what's in the current workspace.\n\nAccording to the context:\n- I'm a subagent spawned by the main agent\n- My task is specific and I should just complete it\n- I should NOT ask questions, just run quietly\n- Expected runtime: up to 60 minutes\n\nLet me start by exploring the workspace and understanding the structure.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll execute this task as the Social Media agent. Let me start by exploring the workspace and understanding the current setup."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_28813e47c78a4bf089b78f89","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-social"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":9988,"output":696,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10684,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead"