{"type":"message","id":"dedcf426","parentId":"3541ac26","timestamp":"2026-02-18T12:47:52.235Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The file doesn't exist. So the script probably failed or didn't complete. Since there was no output, I can't see the error. I need to capture the script's console output. Perhaps the exec tool doesn't capture stdout/stderr of the child process by default. I could modify the script to log to a file explicitly. That's a good idea: have the script write its logs to a file, and also maybe output errors there.\n\nAlternatively, I could have the script run synchronously and then check its exit code, but I still need the logs.\n\nGiven the limitations, I should modify the script to write detailed logs to a file, and also to output to console (which might still be captured). I'll also add try-catch and write errors to a file.\n\nLet me rewrite the script with better logging:\n\n- Use a Logger that writes to both console and a log file.\n- At the end, report success/failure to a status file.\n\nThat way I can read the log file to see what happened.\n\nI'll create a new version of the script, or just append it? I'll overwrite the existing script with improved version.\n\nAlso, I need to handle the fact that the slide generator might not be found; the script will throw. We need to ensure we capture that.\n\nLet me enhance the script.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"The script seems to have exited, but no output files were created. I need better error logging. Let me update the script to write detailed logs to a file and improve error handling."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_534e458662cb4ed3a3f06250","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-social\\analyze-and-generate.js","newText":"/**\n * analyze-and-generate.js\n *\n * 1. Analyzes a sample PDF to extract style characteristics (colors, fonts, layout)\n * 2. Generates a Marp CSS theme matching the sample's style\n * 3. Uses the openclaw slide generator to create a demo deck with the theme\n *\n * Run with: node analyze-and-generate.js\n */\n\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst { createCanvas } = require('canvas');\nconst pdfjsLib = require('pdfjs-dist/legacy/build/pdf.js');\nconst { spawnSync } = require('child_process');\n\n// Set up the PDF.js worker\npdfjsLib.GlobalWorkerOptions.workerSrc = require('pdfjs-dist/legacy/build/pdf.worker.js');\n\n// Configuration\nconst CONFIG = {\n  // Input PDF (from the task)\n  pdfPath: 'C:\\\\Users\\\\mangs\\\\Desktop\\\\Content Marketing\\\\automated_content\\\\sample_slide\\\\1771414106196.pdf',\n\n  // Output files\n  themeCssPath: path.join(__dirname, 'generated-theme.css'),\n  outputPdfPath: path.join(__dirname, 'demo-deck.pdf'),\n  logFilePath: path.join(__dirname, 'analysis.log'),\n  statusFilePath: path.join(__dirname, 'status.json'),\n\n  // Slide generator and example slides (we'll search for these)\n  slideGeneratorSearchNames: ['openclaw-slide-generator.js', 'slide-generator.js', 'generate-slides.js'],\n  exampleSlidesSearchNames: ['example-openclaw-slides.json', 'sample-slides.json', 'slides.json'],\n\n  // Slide dimensions (Marp default is 960x700, but task says 1000x1200)\n  slideWidth: 1000,\n  slideHeight: 1200,\n\n  // Color sampling parameters\n  colorSampleStep: 10, // sample every Nth pixel\n  dominantColorCount: 5\n};\n\n// Logging: write to both console (if captured) and a log file\nconst logStream = fs.createWriteStream(CONFIG.logFilePath, { flags: 'w' });\nfunction log(message) {\n  const line = `[${new Date().toISOString()}] ${message}`;\n  console.log(message);\n  logStream.write(line + '\\n');\n}\nfunction logError(err) {\n  const msg = `ERROR: ${err.message || err}`;\n  log(msg);\n  if (err.stack) {\n    logStream.write(err.stack + '\\n');\n  }\n}\n\n// Write status JSON\nfunction writeStatus(status, details = {}) {\n  const statusObj = { success: status, timestamp: new Date().toISOString(), ...details };\n  try {\n    fs.writeFileSync(CONFIG.statusFilePath, JSON.stringify(statusObj, null, 2));\n    log(`Status written to ${CONFIG.statusFilePath}`);\n  } catch (e) {\n    logError(e);\n  }\n}","old_string":"/**\n * analyze-and-generate.js\n *\n * 1. Analyzes a sample PDF to extract style characteristics (colors, fonts, layout)\n * 2. Generates a Marp CSS theme matching the sample's style\n * 3. Uses the openclaw slide generator to create a demo deck with the theme\n *\n * Run with: node analyze-and-generate.js\n */\n\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst { createCanvas } = require('canvas');\nconst pdfjsLib = require('pdfjs-dist/legacy/build/pdf.js');\n\n// Set up the PDF.js worker\npdfjsLib.GlobalWorkerOptions.workerSrc = require('pdfjs-dist/legacy/build/pdf.worker.js');\n\n// Configuration\nconst CONFIG = {\n  // Input PDF (from the task)\n  pdfPath: 'C:\\\\Users\\\\mangs\\\\Desktop\\\\Content Marketing\\\\automated_content\\\\sample_slide\\\\1771414106196.pdf',\n\n  // Output files\n  themeCssPath: path.join(__dirname, 'generated-theme.css'),\n  outputPdfPath: path.join(__dirname, 'demo-deck.pdf'),\n\n  // Slide generator and example slides (we'll search for these)\n  slideGeneratorSearchNames: ['openclaw-slide-generator.js', 'slide-generator.js', 'generate-slides.js'],\n  exampleSlidesSearchNames: ['example-openclaw-slides.json', 'sample-slides.json', 'slides.json'],\n\n  // Slide dimensions (Marp default is 960x700, but task says 1000x1200)\n  slideWidth: 1000,\n  slideHeight: 1200,\n\n  // Color sampling parameters\n  colorSampleStep: 10, // sample every Nth pixel\n  dominantColorCount: 5\n};"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":29594,"output":1700,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31294,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771418863297}}
