{"type":"message","id":"a06b88b4","parentId":"51a31d3e","timestamp":"2026-02-18T13:00:25.640Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"@napi-rs/canvas already available! That's great. But pdfjs-dist is not found. The require for pdfjs-dist/legacy/build/pdf.js fails. That suggests that pdfjs-dist is not installed, or the path is different. Our ensureDependencies only installed if canvas not found. Since @napi-rs/canvas was already available, we skipped the installation, so pdfjs-dist wasn't installed. We need to also check for pdfjs-dist separately. Let's modify ensureDependencies to ensure both canvas (or any canvas implementation) and pdfjs-dist are installed. We should try to require('pdfjs-dist') and if fails, install it.\n\nBetter: In ensureDependencies, check for pdfjs-dist as well, not just canvas. If either is missing, install both.\n\nLet's update ensureDependencies to attempt to require both.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"The script found @napi-rs/canvas already installed, so it skipped installing pdfjs-dist. I need to ensure pdfjs-dist is also installed. I'll adjust the dependency check to include pdfjs-dist:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_91b8c5bc269a4123aa52b728","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-social\\analyze-and-generate.js","old_string":"// Ensure dependencies\nfunction ensureDependencies() {\n  console.log('Checking dependencies...');\n  try {\n    // Try to require either canvas or @napi-rs/canvas\n    try {\n      require('@napi-rs/canvas');\n      console.log('@napi-rs/canvas already available.');\n    } catch (e) {\n      require('canvas');\n      console.log('canvas already available.');\n    }\n  } catch (e) {\n    console.log('No canvas implementation found. Installing dependencies to temp dir...');\n    const installDir = path.join(TEMP_DIR, 'openclaw_node_modules');\n    if (!fs.existsSync(installDir)) fs.mkdirSync(installDir, { recursive: true });\n\n    // Use npm with shell option\n    const args = ['install', '--prefix', installDir, 'pdfjs-dist@2.16.105', '@napi-rs/canvas'];\n    const result = spawnSync('npm', args, { cwd: installDir, stdio: 'pipe', encoding: 'utf-8', shell: true });\n    const logPath = path.join(TEMP_DIR, 'npm-install.log');\n    if (result.stdout) fs.writeFileSync(logPath, result.stdout);\n    if (result.stderr) fs.appendFileSync(logPath, result.stderr);\n    if (result.status !== 0) {\n      throw new Error(`npm install failed with code ${result.status}. See ${logPath}`);\n    }\n    NODE_INSTALL_DIR = installDir;\n    process.env.NODE_PATH = path.join(installDir, 'node_modules');\n    const Module = require('module');\n    Module._initPaths();\n    console.log('Dependencies installed and module paths updated.');\n  }\n}","new_string":"// Ensure dependencies\nfunction ensureDependencies() {\n  console.log('Checking dependencies...');\n  let hasCanvas = false;\n  let hasPdfjs = false;\n  try {\n    require('@napi-rs/canvas');\n    hasCanvas = true;\n    console.log('@napi-rs/canvas already available.');\n  } catch (e) {\n    try {\n      require('canvas');\n      hasCanvas = true;\n      console.log('canvas already available.');\n    } catch (e2) {}\n  }\n  try {\n    require('pdfjs-dist/legacy/build/pdf.js');\n    hasPdfjs = true;\n    console.log('pdfjs-dist already available.');\n  } catch (e) {}\n\n  if (!hasCanvas || !hasPdfjs) {\n    console.log('Installing missing dependencies to temp dir...');\n    const installDir = path.join(TEMP_DIR, 'openclaw_node_modules');\n    if (!fs.existsSync(installDir)) fs.mkdirSync(installDir, { recursive: true });\n\n    const args = ['install', '--prefix', installDir, 'pdfjs-dist@2.16.105'];\n    if (!hasCanvas) {\n      args.push('@napi-rs/canvas');\n    }\n    const result = spawnSync('npm', args, { cwd: installDir, stdio: 'pipe', encoding: 'utf-8', shell: true });\n    const logPath = path.join(TEMP_DIR, 'npm-install.log');\n    if (result.stdout) fs.writeFileSync(logPath, result.stdout);\n    if (result.stderr) fs.appendFileSync(logPath, result.stderr);\n    if (result.status !== 0) {\n      throw new Error(`npm install failed with code ${result.status}. See ${logPath}`);\n    }\n    NODE_INSTALL_DIR = installDir;\n    process.env.NODE_PATH = path.join(installDir, 'node_modules');\n    const Module = require('module');\n    Module._initPaths();\n    console.log('Dependencies installed and module paths updated.');\n  }\n}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":105096,"output":1295,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106391,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771419610616}}
